# Controls what `gcloud builds submit` / `gcloud run deploy --source` upload as
# the Cloud Build context. Without this file, gcloud falls back to .gitignore —
# which lists `package-lock.json*`, so the (force-tracked) lockfile gets dropped
# from the upload and `npm ci` fails in the Docker build. This file overrides
# that: keep the lockfile and source, only exclude the heavy/regenerated dirs
# (Docker reinstalls deps and rebuilds .next from scratch anyway).
.git
.gitignore
node_modules/
.next/
out/
build/
dist/
coverage/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.env*.local
.DS_Store
